  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/otniel/ontologies/2026/9/financial-health-expert-system">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <owl:versionInfo>2.1.0</owl:versionInfo>
    <rdfs:label>Financial Health Expert System for F&amp;B MSMEs</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Knowledge base for diagnosing the financial health of small F&amp;B businesses. Numbers (growth, margins, baseline bounds, cash change) are computed by the backend and asserted on a MonthlyFinancialState individual; SWRL rules compare them and the reasoner classifies the state. v2: BusinessProfile removed (F&amp;B only), per-month state added, SWRL variables correctly typed swrl:Variable, numeric comparison moved into SWRL. v2.1: reseller/segment analysis removed for the MVP (rules use total figures and the business's own baseline).</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
